       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. Over-the-counter use is limited to 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this level:** GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove these risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg** by mouth four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg** by mouth three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg** by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,600 mg/day total**, which might have been confused with the per-dose amount\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give me the clinical rationale. I'd still suggest checking with pharmacy before it's ordered."
